Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 06:14:41 +0000
Subject: feat(android): render inline-box spans and groups in RichText

Parse inlineBox* props and InlineBoxGroupSpan children in KRRichTextBuilder.
Single-run boxes become one atomic ReplacementSpan so the token wraps as an
inline-block; multi-child groups get edge-advance spans plus word joiners and
keep each child's own styling. The drawer paints one fill/border fragment per
visual line, hit-testing resolves the owning span at atomic boundaries, and
selection/copy map back to the group's semantic text. Placeholder rects are
addressable by "index child" paths.

Fork-Patch: android-richtext-inline-box
